  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Sebastian
    Text: Look boy, I am simply trying to do my job. I already failed at my most
      important duty. Keeping his majesty safe.  If you are persistent on investigating
      you should report to the high priest. They are in the throne room and will
      listen to your suspicions.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -6322953688314822395, guid: c9583b64e73bdd1478a84d540701a034, type: 3}
