    x: -679
    y: 341
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Sebastian
    Text: Well how do you think NIkolaus? Grover is dead and if the Kingdom had been
      holding on by a thread, it is now bond to collapse at any moment. All those
      vultures that had been circling around waiting for the opportunity to strike,
      they have it now.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: -6322953688314822395, guid: c9583b64e73bdd1478a84d540701a034, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: 1098637340302900949}
  ChildNode: {fileID: -2265861453493556102}
  _isExternalFunc: 0
  _externalFunctionName: 
  CharacterNameKey: 
  SentenceTextKey: 
